Output: count_star():BIGINT
Aggregate COUNT(*)
  Join SEMI build=right keys=[tr_pickup = zn_id]
    Filter "((tr_row < 10) OR (tr_row > 2990))"
      Compute ((tr_row < 10) OR (tr_row > 2990))
        Scan table=trips source=parquet(files=1, rows=3000) columns=[tr_row, tr_pickup]
